{%- comment -%}
  WANELO icon library — inline SVG symbol defs, rendered ONCE at the
  top of the master section. Snippets reference icons via:

    <svg class="wanelo-care__icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <use href="#wanelo-icon-care-cold"></use>
    </svg>

  Stroke-based 1.5px lines; currentColor for color inheritance.
  Designer JSON sets item.icon to one of the keys below (e.g. "bolt",
  "care-cold", "gift"). Snippets fall back to no glyph if icon blank.
{%- endcomment -%}
